{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Annota Line </i>is a narrative point-and-click adventure game about a futuristic train heist. Gods are playing tug-of-war with the fabric of reality, and when you steal the most highly sought-after drug in the city, you find yourself caught in the middle of divine affairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this story that unfolds over three acts, you will:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about the diverse cast of characters and the mysteries of the world they inhabit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate rich environments with classic point-and-click controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confront corrupt politicians and drug lords</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try not to get killed</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526440?t=1741988964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526440?t=1741988964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526440/5ece56016d36d8eff85253ff7f3460f8874731a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741988964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526440/5ece56016d36d8eff85253ff7f3460f8874731a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741988964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of violence and drug abuse."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Annota Line </i>is a narrative point-and-click adventure game about a futuristic train heist. Gods are playing tug-of-war with the fabric of reality, and when you steal the most highly sought-after drug in the city, you find yourself caught in the middle of divine affairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this story that unfolds ove